# Game end: All Last (South 4) Tenpai-Yame with leftover stick awarded to 1st (engine.md §5 steps 4-5).
# South 4, dealer=3, sticks=1, scores: 25000 24000 20000 30000.
# Exhaustive draw: ONLY Seat 3 (dealer) is tenpai -> deltas -1000 -1000 -1000 +3000.
# Post-hand scores (before leftover sticks): 24000 23000 19000 33000.
# Dealer is strictly 1st with >= 30000 -> tenpai-yame ends the game!
# Leftover 1000 stick goes to 1st place (Seat 3) -> final_scores: 24000 23000 19000 34000.

